# Android App Project Root

This is the root directory for the PlantVillage Android app prototype.

## Quick Links

- 📖 **[QUICK START](QUICK_START.md)** - Setup in 5 minutes
- 📚 **[Full Documentation](README.md)** - Complete guide
- 🔄 **[Model Conversion](convert_model.py)** - Convert Keras to TFLite
- 💻 **[App Code](app/src/main/java/com/plantvillage/detection/)** - Kotlin source

## Directories

```
├── app/                   # Android app module
├── build.gradle           # Root build config
├── settings.gradle        # Project settings
├── convert_model.py       # Model converter script
├── QUICK_START.md         # 5-minute setup guide
└── README.md              # Full documentation
```

## Next Steps

1. **Setup**: Follow `QUICK_START.md` (5 minutes)
2. **Model**: Run `python convert_model.py` to convert Keras to TFLite
3. **Build**: Open in Android Studio and click Run
4. **Test**: Upload plant images and test predictions

See `README.md` for detailed setup and troubleshooting.
